  "description": "Retrospective listed building consent for the installation of an external stainless-steel twin-wall flue terminal at main roof level, serving a DEFRA-approved wood-burning stove within the basement flat. The flue system is a TWPRO Twin Wall Chimney System (MI Flues), 175mm outer diameter, approximately 1,400mm in height, matt black finish. A small quantity of cement mortar was used to secure the flue base. The installation is wholly reversible and no structural works were carried out. The flue was installed and necessary because of a wall belonging to the adjoining property at 6-8 Westbourne Terrace which partially blocks our chimney space. In addition, our original chimney stack was also removed and capped at some point by 6-8 Westbourne Terrace to accommodate their wall. ",
